  - Which option is correct: the data-answer attribute on the <form>.
  - Colours: search for the hex values (e.g. #8E0F09) and replace them.
  - The prefix "tiy1-": if you put two of these on one page, change it to
    "tiy2-" (or similar) everywhere in the second copy so they don't collide.

